an's minister Musadik Malik elaborated on the site's historical relevance, paying tribute to Mughal emperor Humayun and Afghan ruler Sher Shah Suri. He emphasized the necessity of dialogue among various cultures. The forum, which was kicked off by Prime Minister Narendra Modi, seeks to illuminate India's diverse civilizational heritage via displays and archaeological findings.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/humayun-sher-shah-and-one-fort-pakistan-minister-highlights-purana-quilas-layered-history-at-sco-forum/articleshow/136059561.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/humayun-sher-shah-and-one-fort-pakistan-minister-highlights-purana-quilas-layered-history-at-sco-forum/articleshow/136059561.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T22:55:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136059902,imgsize-87684.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cricketer Yuzvendra Chahal joins BJP, gets role in OBC morcha executive committee]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cricketer-yuzvendra-chahal-joins-bjp-gets-role-in-obc-morcha-executive-committee/articleshow/136059077.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136059077.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cricketer-yuzvendra-chahal-joins-bjp-gets-role-in-obc-morcha-executive-committee/articleshow/136059077.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cricketer-yuzvendra-chahal-joins-bjp-gets-role-in-obc-morcha-executive-committee/articleshow/136059077.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T22:02:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="ima